out.push("\n\n特别注意：如果 CI 测试的是线上正式 Theme，而不是当前 PR 对应的预览 Theme，那么即使测试全部通过，也无法证明当前 PR 没有引入问题。\n\n### 10.2 GitHub Actions 配置\n\n创建 `.github/workflows/accessibility.yml`：\n\n```yaml\nname: Accessibility Quality Gate\n\non:\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\n  workflow_dispatch:\n    inputs:\n      storefront_url:\n        description: URL of the matching test theme\n        required: true\n        type: string\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n\njobs:\n  theme-check:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: '22'\n          cache: npm\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Theme Check\n        run: npm run lint:theme -- --fail-level error\n\n  accessibility:\n    if: github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch'\n    needs: theme-check\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    env:\n      STOREFRONT_URL: ${{ inputs.storefront_url }}\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: '22'\n          cache: npm\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Install Playwright browsers\n        run: npx playwright install --with-deps\n\n      - name: Accessibility tests\n        run: npm run test:a11y\n\n      - name: Upload reports\n        if: always()\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: accessibility-report\n          path: |\n            playwright-report/\n            test-results/\n          retention-days: 14\n```\n\nPlaywright 官方 CI 文档支持这种依赖安装、浏览器安装、测试执行和报告归档的基本流程。");
